    "customfield_12313320": "<div style='font-weight:bold;color:red;text-align:center'>This project has a <a href=\"https://lucene.apache.org/core/discussion.html\">user mailing list and an IRC channel</a> for support. If you are looking for support, or if you are not sure whether the behavior that you are observing is expected or not, please discuss it there first.</div>",
    "customfield_12314134": null,
    "duedate": null,
    "customfield_12314132": null,
    "customfield_12314131": null,
    "comment": {
      "comments": [
        {
          "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/issue/12534176/comment/13164465",
          "id": "13164465",
          "author": {
            "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=rcmuir",
            "name": "rcmuir",
            "key": "rcmuir",
            "avatarUrls": {
              "48x48": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?ownerId=rcmuir&avatarId=10150",
              "24x24": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&ownerId=rcmuir&avatarId=10150",
              "16x16": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&ownerId=rcmuir&avatarId=10150",
              "32x32": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&ownerId=rcmuir&avatarId=10150"
            },
            "displayName": "Robert Muir",
            "active": true,
            "timeZone": "America/New_York"
          },
          "body": "Here's a patch. I did the same for getArray() <-- don't call this if hasArray() returns false or you get UOE, consistent with ByteBuffer.\n\nNow if you try to merge a SlowMultiReaderWrapper, the error is more obvious:\n{noformat}\n    [junit] java.lang.UnsupportedOperationException: asSortedSource is not supported\n    [junit] \tat org.apache.lucene.index.values.IndexDocValues$Source.asSortedSource(IndexDocValues.java:224)\n    [junit] \tat org.apache.lucene.index.values.SortedBytesMergeUtils.buildSlices(SortedBytesMergeUtils.java:89)\n    [junit] \tat org.apache.lucene.index.values.VarSortedBytesImpl$Writer.merge(VarSortedBytesImpl.java:68)\n    [junit] \tat org.apache.lucene.index.codecs.PerDocConsumer.merge(PerDocConsumer.java:84)\n    [junit] \tat org.apache.lucene.index.SegmentMerger.mergePerDoc(SegmentMerger.java:321)\n    [junit] \tat org.apache.lucene.index.SegmentMerger.merge(SegmentMerger.java:124)\n    [junit] \tat org.apache.lucene.index.IndexWriter.addIndexes(IndexWriter.java:2429)\n{noformat}",
          "updateAuthor": {
            "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=rcmuir",
            "name": "rcmuir",
            "key": "rcmuir",
            "avatarUrls": {
